Apply the exact gate to AnalysisAnswer: Every numerical claim matches the materialized result and every semantic qualification matches the plan. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
